-- title:
--   Formally unramified level sets of Ogg's unit on the Γ_H chart
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $p$ and a nonzero $M$ with $p \mid M$ but $p^2 \nmid M$, and a subgroup $H \le (\mathbb{Z}/M)^\times$ containing the kernel of the reduction $(\mathbb{Z}/M)^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/(M/p))^\times$. Assume the Laurent series `jqModC ℚ` (namely $q^{-1}$ times the integral power series $jNum$, base-changed to $\mathbb{Q}$) lies in `qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ ⊤`, the $\mathbb{Q}$-subfield of $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ generated by the ratios of integral forms of full level, and fix a model $\mathfrak{X}$ of type `XHDRModelAtP p M H hpM hj` — the package of a proper, flat, normal integral two-chart model over `R p` of the $\Gamma_H(M)$ $q$-expansion field together with its geometric curve model and Galois compatibilities. Let $v$ be an element of the finite chart ring `chartAlgFin p (ΓM M H) hj`, the subalgebra of elements integral over `R p`-adjoin $j$, whose $q$-expansion is either Ogg's unit `modularUnitSeries p` $= \Delta(q)/\Delta(q^p)$ or $p^{12}$ times its inverse; let $P$ be a prime of that chart ring minimal over $(p)$ with $v \notin P$. Then there is a nonzero $\mathrm{avoid} \in (\mathbb{Z}/p)[X]$ such that for every $h \in \mathbb{Z}[X]$ whose reduction mod $p$ has positive degree, is separable and is coprime to $\mathrm{avoid}$, the quotient of the chart ring by $P + (h(v))$ is nontrivial and formally unramified over $\mathbb{Z}$.
--
--   This is the formally unramified half of the construction of finite étale pieces of the characteristic-$p$ fibre of the $\Gamma_H(M)$ model, cutting out level sets of Ogg's unit $\Delta(q)/\Delta(q^p)$ on a branch of the fibre at $p$. It is used by [`ModularCurve.XHDRModelAtP.exists_finite_etale_quotient_span_aeval_chartAlgFin`](thm.html#ModularCurve.XHDRModelAtP.exists_finite_etale_quotient_span_aeval_chartAlgFin), which upgrades these quotients to finite étale $\mathbb{Z}$-algebras.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_XHDRModelAtP_exists_avoid_forall_formallyUnramified_quotient_quotient_span_aeval_chartAlgFin.lean

